<view class="page"><view class="card user"><view class="avatar">轻</view><view><text class="page-title">{{profile.nickname}}</text><text class="muted">按自己的节奏，慢慢来</text></view></view><view class="card progress"><text>距目标体重</text><text class="big">{{(current.weight || profile.startWeight) - profile.targetWeight}} <small>kg</small></text><text class="muted">目标 {{profile.targetWeight}} kg · 起始 {{profile.startWeight}} kg</text></view><text class="section-title">个人档案</text><view class="card list"><view><text>身高</text><text>{{profile.height}} cm</text></view><view><text>年龄</text><text>{{profile.age}} 岁</text></view><view><text>估算体脂率</text><text>{{current.bodyFat || '待记录'}}{{current.bodyFat ? '%' : ''}}</text></view></view><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="edit">编辑档案与目标</button><view class="card poster"><text>达成目标后，生成你的轻减海报</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="poster">查看目标海报</button></view></view>
